        <summary>Include coarse location data.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Include coarse location data. Indicates whether the caller would not like to receive location related information which will be sent if the caller already possess Manifest.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION and do not renounce the permissions.</para>
